	(text "DESAT pin (internal 500 uA blanking source, trip 8.5-10.0 V) - Rs - 3 x US1M - drain.\nBAT54S keeps DX between COM and VDD against dv/dt through the string; Cblk footprint DNP."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 246.522 211.24 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "5e24f1a9-1f85-563f-9202-b299e9183169")
	)
	(text "Per device: Ron/Roff, 0.5R Kelvin R to the COM star, 10k and Zeners (about +21 V / -5.7 V) on its own Kelvin net.\nMiller hold: N-MOSFET clamp (PMV30ENEA) gate-pin to a local VEE (1u on the Kelvin pin). LAYOUT: FET + 1u at the device, loop <= 1 nH."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 337.221 140.9 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "7a2b9587-5629-58a3-8495-ad6074377811")
	)
	(text "S1: ISOLATED BIAS +18 V / -3.5 V"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 198.445 19 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "9f46a0fa-2da3-5fcb-b31a-4a993398abe7")
	)
	(text "SYMMETRY: gate and Kelvin of S1a/S1b as coupled pairs of equal length (+/-10 %) from the COM_S1 star; Ron,\nRoff, Kelvin R, 10k, Zeners at each device; power sources joined only by the busbar. CLAMP LOOP: each\nAO3400A + C_VL at its device's gate-Kelvin pins, loop <= 1 nH. IC-22: milled slot between the drain\npin 1 and pins 2-4 of each TO-247-4L; DESAT string >= 2.5 mm pad gap per diode; board coated to PD1.\nMiller hold (gdrv rev 5, ngspice 1100 V / 72.4 A, 115 V/ns): die +1.41 V vs VGS(th) min 1.94 V at 175 C,\nmargin 0.53 V (rev 4 PNP: +2.14 V) - BENCH TEST (double pulse, hot, minimum-threshold devices)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 341.522 179.9 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "b5504e2b-810c-5577-8f9f-99e131bb0356")
	)
	(text "MMBT3906 inverter (E COM, base BAT54+2.2k on CLAMP) drives CG to COM once the lowest gate is below ~-1.2 V;\nMMBT3904 release (from OUTH via 5.6 V Zener) holds CG at VEE while OUTH drives."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 241.28 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "c3551e8c-403b-54f5-be40-ea52c105c11d")
	)
	(text "UCC14241-Q1, 24 V in, regulated +/-1.3 %, reinforced barrier.\nRDR: RLIM1 sources COM, RLIM2 + DLIM sink it."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 198.445 131.948 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "c7955e32-3c6f-5f9c-b4b6-917ce48787c9")
	)
	(text "S1: LAYOUT RULES + MILLER MARGIN"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 341.522 153.4 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "deb7b2ab-2901-5422-8a83-1dcbbb35036e")
	)
	(text "IN+ = own PWM; IN- = complementary switch, falling edge stretched 4.02k/100p\n(interlock + min dead time = max(firmware, hardware)). Bias PG (active low) pulls RDY low."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 98.792 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "ed6c2544-b687-5846-bf97-de9a4351a176")
	)
	(text "DESAT > 10.3-10.9 V (above the 10.0 V maximum trip of the -Q1 grade) -> MMBT3904 -> MMBT3906 charges BG to VEE + 10 V;\nper device AO3400A + 22R pull the gate to VEE; BG holds ~3 us (1k + FET gates)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 124.222 216.792 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "ef6beae9-dd74-56df-b7d4-a121ee960900")
	)
	(text "S1: DESAT"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 246.522 153.4 0)
		(effects
